   "locked": false,
   "text": "The coordination service is deliberately SEPARATE\nconsensus costs a quorum round trip per write: fine at one write per\nleadership change, fatal at 488,000 messages/sec",
   "originalText": "The coordination service is deliberately SEPARATE\nconsensus costs a quorum round trip per write: fine at one write per\nleadership change, fatal at 488,000 messages/sec",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "w2",
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "wn",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 30,
   "y": 806,
   "width": 1011,
   "height": 65,
   "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 100058,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 700406,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Splitting the broker would mean shipping bytes over a network between components that are currently a function call apart -\nturning the design's central asset (sequential local disk at 150 MB/sec) into a network hop. Merging the coordination service\nwould either make the log slow or the cluster map unsafe: a split-brain map means two brokers both believing they lead one\npartition, and since an offset is a message's only identity, the log would fork with no way to reconcile.",
   "originalText": "Splitting the broker would mean shipping bytes over a network between components that are currently a function call apart -\nturning the design's central asset (sequential local disk at 150 MB/sec) into a network hop. Merging the coordination service\nwould either make the log slow or the cluster map unsafe: a split-brain map means two brokers both believing they lead one\npartition, and since an offset is a message's only identity, the log would fork with no way to reconcile.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
